    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "One of the most expensive places I\u2019ve been is a Mall in my hometown.
    It\u2019s located in the financial center where transportation there is convenient.
    I remember walking into the mall just out of curiosity, and I was shocked by
    the price tags. Even a small handbag could cost tens of thousands of yuan. Besides
    shopping, the food there is also expensive. I once had afternoon tea at a caf\xE9
    there, and it cost nearly 100 yuan for just a cup of coffee and some pastries.
    Although the place is expensive, I have to admit that the atmosphere is very
    high-end and elegant."
